{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1753032780\" width=800 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.webm?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL IN A FLICK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are Jimmy Flickerman, an agoraphobic young man living with his father in their family-run shop. Unable to leave due to your condition, your days pass by helping your father and playing video games. But when your father suddenly takes a short trip, everything changes in a flick. Now, the entire shop and every... single... task... falls on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/8d15afcee256688d62a1d747e1e3d8f8.poster.avif?t=1753032780\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/8d15afcee256688d62a1d747e1e3d8f8.webm?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/8d15afcee256688d62a1d747e1e3d8f8.mp4?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAKE UP</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And check your e-mails. Feed your fish. Manage the store and handle your... lovely customers. Spend your days searching for answers: Where did he go? Why isn\u2019t he answering his phone? What\u2019s really going on? And most importantly... who are these people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/d1c7ab08890d9038890768ba7cb0b59b.poster.avif?t=1753032780\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/d1c7ab08890d9038890768ba7cb0b59b.webm?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/d1c7ab08890d9038890768ba7cb0b59b.mp4?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAY AND NIGHT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, spend your time dealing with the customers and fixing their consoles before calling it a night. By night, rest up to face a new day. Stay safe and... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/c601868d3304794e21c51c4247f7217f.poster.avif?t=1753032780\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/c601868d3304794e21c51c4247f7217f.webm?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/c601868d3304794e21c51c4247f7217f.mp4?t=1753032780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY\u00a0FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive first-person narrative in a unique business simulation setting.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, repair, and assemble vintage game consoles.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain prices with customers, navigating the ever-changing market.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business and increase your renown in the community.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in branching conversations through an interactive dialogue system.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and build important relationships.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a mysterious story through introspective inner monologues.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an eerie, retro-dystopian world full of analog charm.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed and care for your pet fish. (THE MOST IMPORTANT ONE!),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage everything from the comfort and safety of your cozy little store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880420?t=1753032780","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/663d5ce283ad7faa8ecd6a311c91bc28d0b463fe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753032780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/2badfe1229566c128926017420b25d3f389e51bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753032780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/2badfe1229566c128926017420b25d3f389e51bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753032780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1753032780\" width=800 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/